OL,3,AAfrica's richest man helps fund $660m
OL,4,Afuel pipeline between Ethiopia and
OL,5,ADjibouti
OL,6,
OL,7,FNigerian billionaire Aliko Dangote has
OL,8,Fannounced that he is helping to fund a
OL,9,Fnew $660m (#500m) fuel pipeline between
OL,10,FEthiopia and Djibouti
OL,12,FThe project will include a 120km- (75
OL,13,Fmile-) pipeline connecting Djibouti's
OL,14,FDamerjog port to a distribution
OL,15,Ffacility in Dewele, Ethiopia, as well
OL,16,Fas storage capacity of about 400
OL,17,Fmillion litres.
OL,19,FIt is expected to begin operations
OL,20,Fwithin 18 months.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,116,105,200,300,0,100
