OL,3,AAfrica's richest man helps fund $660m
OL,4,Afuel pipeline between Ethiopia and
OL,5,ADjibouti
OL,6,
OL,7,FEthiopian Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed
OL,8,Fsaid the pipeline would reduce the time
OL,9,Fneeded to transport fuel from
OL,10,FDjibouti's port to the Ethiopian
OL,11,Fcapital, Addis Ababa, from five days to
OL,12,Fone.
